pan></span><br></div><br></div>Thank you for your help, and please be patient as I find time to address any issues.</div><div><br>Terrence D. Jorgensen    (he, him, his)<br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(26,115,232)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414482903000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fOVkAT7YxsZx704sxkGZj\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a><br><br></div>"
